cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Gemma Tounsi 1.0 or this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Gemma Tounsi 1.0 (27B): a Tunisian-adapted Gemma 3 27B model"
abstract: >-
  Gemma Tounsi 1.0 adapts Gemma 3 27B to Tunisian Arabic (Derja and Arabizi)
  using QLoRA, with dedicated evaluation tracks for Derja, Arabizi, and
  retention of the base model's general capabilities. This repository contains
  the dataset preparation, mixture definitions, evaluation harnesses, and
  release orchestration; training is performed with the external open-source
  Soup training engine.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0

